        "result": "{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"{\\\"provider\\\":\\\"duckduckgo\\\",\\\"query\\\":\\\"Python 3.13 release date\\\",\\\"results\\\":[{\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"Release date : Oct. 7, 2024 This is the stable release of Python 3.13.0 Python 3.13.0 is the newest major release of the Python programming language, and it contains many new features and optimizations compared to Python 3.12. (Compared to the last release candidate, 3.13.0rc3, 3.13.0 contains two small bug fixes and some documentation and testing changes.) Major new features of the 3.13 series ...\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Python Release Python 3.13.0 | Python.org\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-3130/\\\"},{\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"This document describes the development and release schedule for Python 3.13 , which is expected to be released on 2024-10-01. It also provides the release manager, crew, and lifespan information for Python 3.13 .\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"PEP 719 - Python 3.13 Release Schedule | peps.python.org\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://peps.python.org/pep-0719/\\\"},{\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"Python 3.13 was released on October 7, 2024, with new features such as a better interactive interpreter, free-threaded mode, and JIT compiler. See the changelog, PEPs, and porting guide for details.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"What's New In Python 3.13 \u2014 Python 3.13.18 documentation\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://docs.python.org/3.13/whatsnew/3.13.html\\\"},{\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"Release date : Dec. 3, 2024 This is the first maintenance release of Python 3.13 Python 3.13 is the newest major release of the Python programming language, and it contains many new features and optimizations compared to Python 3.12. 3.13.1 is the latest maintenance release , containing almost 400 bugfixes, build improvements and documentation changes since 3.13.0. Security content in this ...\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Python Release Python 3.13.1 | Python.org\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-3131/\\\"},{\\\"snippet\\\":\\\"Status of Python versions \u00b6 The main branch is currently the future Python 3.16, and is the only branch that accepts new features. The latest release for each Python version can be found on the download page.\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Status of Python versions\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://devguide.python.org/versions/\\\"}]}\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"isError\":false}",
